#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy-pro/client/dns.js:132
msgid ""
"Resolves every domain that is not on the China DNS path, through the "
"selected proxy node. A domestic resolver answers these queries with polluted "
"or NXDOMAIN results, which is what makes a foreign site fail to resolve "
"while the proxy itself works - so only overseas services are offered here. "
"Support UDP, TCP, DoH, DoQ, DoT. TCP protocol will be used if not specified."
msgstr ""
"解析所有不在中国解析路径上的域名，并通过所选代理节点发出查询。国内解析器会返"
"回被污染或 NXDOMAIN 的结果，这正是代理本身正常、境外网站却解析失败的原因，因"
"此这里只提供境外服务。支持 UDP、TCP、DoH、DoQ、DoT，未指定协议时使用 TCP。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy-pro/client/dns.js:177
msgid ""
"Resolves the domains on the China path, so it has to be a domestic service "
"to get the correct local CDN answers. Keep the default; the upstream may "
"block UDP/53, in which case a DoH address (https://dns.alidns.com/dns-query, "
"https://doh.pub/dns-query) also works. Support UDP, TCP, DoH, DoQ, DoT. This "
"address is also the resolver the proxy DNS server above uses to look up its "
"own hostname when that one is a domain - and a URL here is a domain, which "
"cannot do that lookup itself, so with a URL here the proxy DNS server falls "
"back to the WAN resolver. Enter the bare IP form of the same service to keep "
"that lookup on this router."
msgstr ""
"解析走中国大陆路径的域名，所以必须是国内服务，才能拿到正确的本地 CDN 结果。保持"
"默认即可；上游可能封锁 UDP/53，此时改填 DoH 地址（https://dns.alidns.com/"
"dns-query、https://doh.pub/dns-query）也可用。支持 UDP、TCP、DoH、DoQ、DoT。"
"这个地址同时是上方代理 DNS 服务器解析自身域名所用的解析器（当上方填的是域名"
"时）；而 URL 本身就是域名，无法完成这次解析——所以此处填 URL 时，上方代理 DNS "
"服务器会退回由 WAN 解析器解析。想避免就把这里填成同一服务的裸 IP。"

